   "created_utc": "2014-12-12T06:36:42Z",
   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "Why not study an existing implementation? <a href=\"http://gee.cs.oswego.edu/dl/html/malloc.html\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">gee.cs.oswego.edu/dl/html/malloc.html</a> is a good starting point. Once you&#39;ve done that, you&#39;ll be able to come up with additional ideas (for example, add a magic signature to the chunk header, and check that signature in <code>free()</code>)."
